  "description": "‘So’, known for being a loyal general for the royal family, is betrayed and abandoned by them in an instant. Now all that’s left for ‘So’ is despair and skepticism. Having lost even the will to live, he throws himself into the ocean. Just before his death, a strange afterimage of something flickers through his vision…When he opens his eyes, there is a mysterious girl kissing him upon the sand…?! “What is this! A grown woman is stripped naked and climbing on top of a man!” “I was just trying to treat your wounds?” “?”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/bluestar), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/bluestar_), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000080348), \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14477937), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260582)",
